# wrangler's local state: the simulated KV store `wrangler dev` writes to,
# plus its caches. Never committed, never uploaded (see .assetsignore).
.wrangler/

# Agent task reports, review packages, anything else dot-task prefixed - working
# notes, not site content. Deliberately extension-less: `wrangler deploy`
# uploads the working DIRECTORY, not the git tree, so .assetsignore carries the
# same glob and it is the one that actually keeps these off getstash.link.
.task-*
